{"unit_id": "tag:05B5:statement", "translation": "设\n<MATH_0001>\n为概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）构成的交换图表（commutative diagram）。假设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002>满射（surjective）、平坦（flat）且局部有限表现（locally of finite presentation），\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0003>光滑（smooth）（分别为<SPACE_0001>平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale））。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n则<MATH_0004>光滑（smooth）（分别为<SPACE_0002>平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale））。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图表"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表现"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0002>tale", "target_term": "平展"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "图表中的概形，待决"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "图表中的态射，待决"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图表", "context": "所给交换图表，待决"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "覆盖态射满射，待决"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "覆盖态射平坦，待决"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表现", "context": "覆盖态射的有限性，待决"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "态射光滑性，待决"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "第一对应平展性，重音保护，待决"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0002>tale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "结论对应平展性，重音保护，待决"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:05B7:proof", "translation": "由引理<REF_0001>可知，<MATH_0001>有限表现（finite presentation）。由态射（Morphisms）引理<REF_0002>可知，<MATH_0002>平坦（flat）。由态射（Morphisms）引理<REF_0003>，现在只需证明局部环（local rings）（取自<MATH_0003>的纤维（fibres）及<MATH_0004>的纤维（fibres））是局部完全交（local complete intersection）环（rings）。为此，可以取<MATH_0005>在点（point）<MATH_0006>处的纤维（fibre），即可以假设<MATH_0007>是一个域（field）的谱（spectrum）。选取点（point）<MATH_0008>，其像（image）为<MATH_0009>，并考虑环映射（ring map）\n<MATH_0010>\n。这是局部（local）诺特（Noetherian）环（rings）之间的平坦（flat）局部同态（local homomorphism）。局部环（local ring）<MATH_0011>是完全交（complete intersection）。因此可以利用 Avramov 的结果，见除幂（Divided Power）代数（Algebra）引理<REF_0004>，得出<MATH_0012>和<MATH_0013>都是完全交（complete intersection）环（rings）。\n", "allowed_english": ["Avramov"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表现"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "local complete intersection", "target_term": "局部完全交"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "local homomorphism", "target_term": "局部同态"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "complete intersection", "target_term": "完全交"}, {"source_term": "Divided Power", "target_term": "除幂"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "complete intersection", "target_term": "完全交"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表现", "context": "原文所称态射性质，待决"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引用章节名，待决"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "态射及局部同态的平坦性，待决"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "纤维的局部环，待决"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "态射的纤维，待决"}, {"source_term": "local complete intersection", "target_term": "局部完全交", "context": "纤维局部环的性质，待决"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "局部及完全交环，待决"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "所取概形的点，待决"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "在所取点处的纤维，待决"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "归约中的域，待决"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱", "context": "域的谱，待决"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "点的像，待决"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "两局部环之间的映射，待决"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部", "context": "诺特环的局部性，待决"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "局部环诺特性，待决"}, {"source_term": "local homomorphism", "target_term": "局部同态", "context": "局部环之间的同态，待决"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "所取局部环，待决"}, {"source_term": "complete intersection", "target_term": "完全交", "context": "完全交性质，待决"}, {"source_term": "Divided Power", "target_term": "除幂", "context": "引用章节名的限定部分，待决"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "引用章节名，待决"}], "notes": ["remark：英文来源称该态射为有限表现；候选保留这句话，不改为局部有限表现。"]}
